export anchor RisographStyle:
    number: 53
    screen: Pricing
    name: Risograph
    idea: A two-ink risograph zine in fluorescent pink and blue, where the inks overprint into violet, every heading sits slightly off register and a fine grain covers the paper.
    base: light
    palette:
        paper: #f4f1ea, the page and the Free plan card
        fluoroPink: #ff48b0, ink for shapes, offset heading copies, halftone dots and hard shadows, never small text
        pinkInk: #b0125f, small pink words, arrows and not included crosses
        pinkTint: #ffc2e2, the Team card, the Team column and the current nav
        risoBlue: #0078bf, large headings and blue shapes
        blueInk: #3255a4, the primary button, links and included dots
        deepOverprint: #1a2a6c, body text, rules, outlines and focus
        blueTint: #bfe0f5, the Business card
        overprint: multiply, where pink and blue cross and turn violet
    type:
        Display is Arial Black, Helvetica Neue, Franklin Gothic Heavy,
        Arial, sans-serif at 900 with tight tracking. Text is Courier
        Prime, Courier New, ui-monospace, Menlo, Consolas, monospace. The
        title is up to 168px on a 0.88 line, prices 76px, section titles
        52px, plan names 40px, questions 20px, body 16px on a 1.6 line and
        labels 13px bold mono capitals.
    layout:
        A light header with a logo of a pink circle overprinting a blue
        square, mono capital nav with the current item on a pink
        highlighter band and a wavy underline, and a torn zigzag strip in
        blue. The hero sets the title in riso blue with a pink copy offset
        slightly down and right beneath it, a tilted dark label above, a
        mono line and a square billing switch with a dashed pink stamp for
        2 months free. A large pink circle with halftone dots overprints a
        tilted blue rectangle at the right. Three plan cards tilt by
        different small angles, each with a deep outline and a pink
        duplicate outline offset 5px, a halftone or solid spot at the top
        corner, a pink dollar sign, a big price, an arrow list on dotted
        rules and a button. Team is pink tinted with a dark Most popular
        sticker, Business blue tinted. The comparison table tints the Team
        column pink, and questions use pink number discs. Below 900px the
        cards stack.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 24px card padding, 28px gutters and 88px between sections.
    density: Medium and loose, like a zine spread with tilted, staggered cards.
    corners: Square cards and buttons. Round only for ink blobs, halftone dots and number discs.
    borders: 2px deep outline on cards with a pink duplicate offset 5px right and 4px down, dotted 2px rules between rows and a torn zigzag strip under the header.
    shadows: No blur. Hard pink offsets of 5px by 4px behind buttons, as a second ink layer. A fractal noise grain covers the whole page at 22 percent opacity, multiplied.
    icons:
        Printed glyphs only. Arrows as list marks, a filled dot for
        included, a cross for not included, an empty and a filled circle on
        the billing switch and a star on the sticker.
    focus: A 3px deep outline offset 3px with a pink offset halo. A focused field gains a pink offset shadow and a blue border.
    tone: Plain and a little handmade, such as Printed in two inks and plan by plan.
